  "construction_notes": [
    {
      "text": "City's July 2026 Significant Projects list still shows the earlier 98 detached homes plus 73 townhome-style condos on 20.56 acres. City page: 105 detached homes on about 15.8 acres under a builder's remedy settlement.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001422",
        "SRC-001425"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Reported: no affordable units in the 105 homes; in-lieu payments, and a separate 4.7-acre parcel to go to the city for affordable housing.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001426"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Settlement agreement: original site 20.56 gross acres, APNs 728-31-017 and -019. A 7.8248-acre site to the north is split off by lot line adjustment for potential retail, likely grocery-anchored. 4.719 acres planned for townhomes go to the city for affordable housing within 30 days of final approval. Up to 105 market-rate homes on the remaining 15.84 acres.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-002990"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "CEQA notice: 114 lots, 105 detached homes, 2.27-acre detention basin, 0.47-acre stormwater area, about 0.49 acre of common open space, residential development area 7.36 acres. Lists APNs 728-31-017 and 728-31-019; the city page lists 728-31-022 as the updated parcel. General Plan General Commercial; zoning PUD, CO and CH.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-002991",
        "SRC-001425"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "State report 2024: SR2024-0011, 171 single-family units for sale, application dated 2024-04-02, pending, reported as ministerial.",
